    "en": "Press your hands straight out, don't let the band turn you"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cue2",
   "primary": false,
   "text": {
    "zh": "侧对拴带的地方站直，膝盖微微松开别锁死。",
    "en": "Stand tall side-on to the anchor, knees soft, not locked."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cue3",
   "primary": false,
   "text": {
    "zh": "推直了停两秒，再收回胸口。",
    "en": "Hold it out for two seconds, then bring it back to your chest."
   }
  }
 ],
